  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced capacity of constituents to address recovery needs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO will promote the EIIP methodology as an important step in that facilitates the recovery and reconstruction phase. The approach applies the general principles of the labour-intensive investment methodology, based on international best practices, and the guiding principles manual prepared jointly with the ILO.</narrative>
  </description>
